# MediGuide local config — copy to .env for local runs (never commit .env).
# The deployed web app talks to the Spring Boot backend at this URL when set;
# when empty, the app runs in its built-in demo mode (curated explanations,
# schedule builder fully offline). No Gemini key ever belongs in this file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://mediguide-backend.example.com
